{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"accusations\": [\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"至少六篇未具名预印本，涉及不同研究的版本关联（version_of）\",\n      \"pmid\": \"23225012（错误映射的 PMID）\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1101/2025.01.10.632393\",\n      \"report_says\": \"报告 X 的结构化参考文献将至少六篇不同预印本的 version_of 错误地指向 PMID:23225012。对于 DOI 10.1101/2025.01.10.632393，正文标注其对应 PMID:40709562，但结构化附录却标注为 PMID:23225012。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"PMID:23225012 实际对应的是一篇2012年发表的一般性帕金森病综述，而不是这些预印本。报告正文与结构化附录对同一 DOI 的 PMID 映射也互相矛盾，造成预印本版本关联和文献去重错误。评审未进一步确认 PMID:40709562 是否为该 DOI 的正确对应记录。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"低频自适应 DBS 预印本（具体题名及 DOI 未在评审意见中提供）\",\n      \"pmid\": \"24245947\",\n      \"doi\": \"\",\n      \"report_says\": \"报告 X 将低频自适应 DBS 预印本映射至 PMID:24245947。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"PMID:24245947 实际对应的是一篇2013年发表的一般性 DBS 综述，而不是低频自适应 DBS 预印本，因此该文献映射错误。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1abb2574-08df-4ce1-998d-8daf2b88d635", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T200258493051Z", "elapsed_seconds": 51.343, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T20:03:49.863198+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a458e86ec44d74166f3b3e12b0382457ca91306911639c34262da8b7f12d37fd", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": f